  "description": "Hey, man! Ren & Stimpy are back in a collection of games that will satisfy even the sickest little monkeys. \n\nAbout This Game\nThis collection includes the following games:\n•\tBuckeroo$! (1993, 8-bit & 16-bit)\n•\tSpace Cadet Adventures (1992, handheld)\n•\tVeediots! (1993, 8-bit & handheld)\n•\tFire Dogs (1994, 16-bit)\n•\tTime Warp (1994, 16-bit)\n\nHey kids - start jumping up and down like idiots, because look what's new in this collection:\n•\tSave any where and any time - this helpful feature will allow you to take a litter box break and return right where you left off!\n•\tRewind - If you're sucked into the hideous vortex of a black hole, don't fear - you can rewind and try again!\n•\tMuseum Viewer - Nothing could be more fun than viewing original packaging and manuals for each of the included games!\nYes, when it's this much fun - it must be the Ren & Stimpy Happy, Happy, Joy, Joy Collection, from Blammo!",
